  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN215.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">celavuṇarttiya tōḻi talaimakaḷatu kuṟippaṟintu talaimakaṉaic celavaḻuṅkac colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante, who has informed [her] of [his] going, said after having understood HER intentions in order to prevent HIM from going.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN215.1">
        <l>vilaṅkiruñ cimaiyak kuṉṟat timpar</l>
        <l>vēṟupaṉ moḻiya tēeya muṉṉi</l>
        <l>vaḷanacaip parikku muraṉmali neñcamoṭu</l>
        <l>puṉaimā ṇeḵkam va<supplied>la</supplied>vayi ṉēntic</l>
        <l>celaṉmā<supplied>ṇ</supplied> puṟṟa numvayiṉ vallē</l>
        <l>valaṉā keṉṟalu naṉṟumaṟ ṟillat</l>
        <l>tettup piḻaikkuva tāyiṟ ṟoṭutta</l>
        <l>kaiviral kavvuṅ kallāk kāṭci</l>
        <l>koṭumaram piṭitta kōṭā vaṉkaṇ</l>
        <l>vaṭinavi lampi ṉēva lāṭava</l>
        <l>rāḷaḻit tuyartta vañcuvaru patukkaik</l>
        <l>kūrnutic cevvā yeruvaic cēval</l>
        <l>paṭupiṇap paintalai toṭuvaṉa kuḻīi</l>
        <l>mallaṉ mocivira loṟṟi maṇikoṇṭu</l>
        <l>valvāyp pēṭaikkuc coriyu māṅkaṭ</l>
        <l>kaḻintōrk kiraṅku neñcamō</l>
        <l>ṭaḻintava <supplied>ṇu</supplied>ṟaita lāṟṟu vōrkkē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="6ab">Saying “may there be victory</l>
        <l corresp="5">quickly, on the part of you who experience the glory of going,</l>
        <l corresp="2">approaching lands with many different languages</l>
        <l corresp="1">next to the hills with transverse large summits,</l>
        <l corresp="4">holding up on [your] right a blade glorious for [its] make,</l>
        <l corresp="3">with a heart abounding in strength that runs on the yearning for riches,”</l>
        <l rend="indent4" corresp="6bc">is all very well,</l>
        <l corresp="17">– for those capable of remaining there in desolation,</l>
        <l corresp="16">with a heart that laments those who passed away</l>
        <l corresp="12 15d">in that place where males of the Brahminy kite with sharp-tipped red beaks</l>
        <l corresp="13">crowd together, digging into the fresh skulls of fallen corpses</l>
        <l corresp="11">on the frightening stone heaps erected after men have been destroyed</l>
        <l corresp="10">by men commanding well-trained arrows</l>
        <l corresp="9">with a strength that does not waver when they grip [their] bows,</l>
        <l corresp="8">with untaught sight that grabs the fingers of the hand that joined [the arrow](?),</l>
        <l corresp="6d-7c">if the deception of the house fails,</l>
        <l corresp="14">press with [their] forceful pressing claws, take the eye balls [out</l>
        <l corresp="15a-c">and] strew them for [their] strong-beaked females.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

